Z||000000||V8Fiero||04-08-2001||12:14 AM||||Have any of you had any problems with the length of your axles once you did the swap. After the install of my engine the pass. side axle was too short and the drivers side is too long. <BR>I had the pass one lengthened but the drivers side is already very short. I took it to one shop to have it shortened and they wouldnt even touch it.<BR>Any suggestions????<BR>Would another one from another car work?<P>Im kind of baffled cause I dont think Im going to be able to get the one tire aligned..<P>Help<BR>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||04-08-2001||03:42 AM||||Archie's kit leaves the transmission in the exact same spot so your axle's should fit without a problem. Did you slide the engine to the left for some reason?||||reg||1
Z||000002||pherder||04-08-2001||10:31 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Archie's kit leaves the transmission in the exact same spot so your axle's should fit without a problem. Did you slide the engine to the left for some reason?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, it moves the transaxle to the left ~1/2" <B>BUT</B> it still doesn't require the axles to be modified.  <P>I did the transaxle move on my 88 Coupe's HO Quad 4 swap so that the cam tower would not be in the way of the decklid hinge ... worked will good!<P>Paul<P>------------------<BR>88 Formula<BR>88 Coupe<BR>86 SE<BR>95 GMC<BR>92 Mazda<BR>55 Jones<BR>Sedgwick, KS 67135||||reg||1
Z||000003||V8Fiero||04-08-2001||12:32 PM||||See, This is what baffles me. Every one says that it is in the same spot. My harmonic balancer pulley just barely clears the frame on the pass side, and the tranny is almost up against the frame on the other side. So as you see there isnt much more that I could do...oh yea. Its an 84 auto. Not sure if that is what caused my problem....<BR>almost forgot...my water pump is right by the frame rail also......any other suggestions........?<P><BR>Scott<p>[This message has been edited by V8Fiero (edited 04-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||hugh||04-08-2001||12:43 PM||||Call Archie,If anyone can help he can!||||reg||1
